WEBVTT

00:06:28.712 --> 00:06:31.053
But there's a crucial caveat:

00:06:31.077 --> 00:06:34.796
it only works if you've already
proven your competence.

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:38.876
You were impressive before,
but now you're relatable, too.

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:40.684
(Music)

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:43.934
AG: For Mohamed, being authentic worked

00:06:43.934 --> 00:06:47.090
because he had already
established his qualifications.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:49.906
The metal traders knew
he wasn't just an economist.

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.176
He had been a wildly successful trader,

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:54.466
then the CEO of a big financial company

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:57.942
and the chair of President Obama's
Global Development Council.

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:01.056
Plus, on top of his credentials,